[Desktop Entry]
Name=系统快照时光机
Name[en_US]=System Snapshot & Time Machine
Comment=类似虚拟机的一键创建快照与时光机倒流还原
Comment[en_US]=VM-like instant Btrfs snapshots and full system rollback
Exec=wezterm start -- ujust snapshot
Icon=system-software-update
Terminal=false
Type=Application
Categories=System;Settings;Utility;
Keywords=snapshot;backup;restore;rollback;timemachine;快照;还原;时光机;备份;
